			text = [=[The Trade District is the busiest quarter of {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link}. Its streets hold the bank, the auction house, the inn called the Gilded Rose and shops of every craft. {link:morgan-pestle}Morgan Pestle{/link} sells his potions here, and the {link:elling-trias}Trias{/link} family sells cheese. Gryphons land at the district's edge, carrying letters and travellers from across the kingdom. Beneath all the bargaining runs the city's oldest trade of all, which is rumor. What is heard in the Trade District at noon is known in the Keep by evening.]=],
