			text = [=[The harbor of Stormwind has grown busy again. A new vessel now crosses the sea from its southern dock to {link:auberdine}Auberdine{/link} on the shores of {link:darkshore}Darkshore{/link}, and it carries supplies, letters and travellers between the kingdom and the lands of the {link:night-elves}night elves{/link}. Clerks count cargo by the crate, and there are never enough dockhands. Guards and cannoneers watch the water. Merchants of the city have already sent kin across the water to trade in Auberdine, and letters come back the other way asking for help. For the first time in years, the city looks outward across the sea.]=],
