			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Bolvar holds the realm together in its most uncertain hour. He must answer the pleas of every troubled border, from {link:redridge-mountains}Redridge{/link} to the {link:wetlands}Wetlands{/link}, with an army that is already stretched thin. He leans on the counsel of those around him. Among them, none is heard more often than {link:katrana-prestor}Lady Katrana Prestor{/link}.]=],
