			text = [=[From {link:menethil-harbor}Menethil Harbor{/link} in the {link:wetlands}Wetlands{/link} came a small statue of King {link:terenas-menethil}Terenas Menethil{/link}, recovered after a long search. The harbor's keepers feared to hold it in a land beset by enemies. They sent it straight to Bolvar, trusting that he would know where such a memory of {link:lordaeron}Lordaeron{/link}'s king should be kept.]=],
