			text = [=[Lady Katrana Prestor is a noblewoman of great influence. She stands in the throne room of {link:stormwind-keep}Stormwind Keep{/link} beside {link:bolvar-fordragon}Highlord Bolvar Fordragon{/link}, and she speaks for the court when the court must speak. Petitioners who come to the Keep often find that their words reach the regent only after they have reached her.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[In a court without a king, the counsel of a trusted advisor carries the weight of law. Lady Prestor's voice is heard on every great question of the realm: what the kingdom can spare, whom it should believe, and which of its troubles can safely be ignored. Some in the kingdom admire her wisdom. Others, far from the capital, have begun to wonder why their pleas so rarely find an answer.

She is always present. When the regent receives a petition, she is at his side. When a report comes for the absent king, it is she who takes it. When the regent must decide, he asks for her counsel first. No lord of the {link:house-of-nobles}House of Nobles{/link} has so close a place at the heart of the kingdom.]=],
		},
		{
			title = "Deeds",
			text = [=[• She counsels the regent on the affairs of the kingdom.
