			},
			text = [=[The report was addressed to {link:varian-wrynn}King Varian{/link}. It told of the {link:defias-brotherhood}Defias{/link}, of {link:gregor-lescovar}Lord Gregor Lescovar{/link}'s treason and of the assassin in the royal garden. Lady Prestor received it herself. She thanked its bearer and explained that the king was away on a diplomatic mission.]=],
