		},
		{
			title = "Significance",
			text = [=[Baros stands at the crossing of {link:stormwind-city}Stormwind{/link}'s oldest wound. The city he tends was rebuilt by the masons who became the {link:defias-brotherhood}Defias Brotherhood{/link}. When {link:edwin-vancleef}Edwin VanCleef{/link} wrote a letter he never sent, it was addressed to Baros. Through the architect, the story of the Brotherhood passes from the {link:the-deadmines}Deadmines{/link} to the {link:the-stockade}Stockade{/link}, from {link:si-7}SI:7{/link} to the throne room.]=],
