				{ type = "quest", id = 399 },
			},
			text = [=[Baros once had a house in {link:westfall}Westfall{/link}. He left something behind there: an old compass, the tool of his first craft. Westfall is dangerous now, and its farms have fallen to thieves and ruin. But a builder does not forget the instrument that first taught him to draw a straight line.]=],
